ere one state  goes against another within the US is  that going to be acceptable no that's  going to hold or that's completely  politically incorrect and we  there should be no pride whatsoever in  in your state no Liz I am NOT you know I  think that the left is often unfairly  characterized as lacking all pride and I  hate to even in term patriotism but in a  way sort of accused of lacking  patriotism and I completely reject that  we talked about how when we criticize  our health care system it's not because  we are unpatriotic it's because we are  trying to raise the country up to a  higher standard it's a different form of  patriotism and then when it comes to  soccer you can make the case that in a  sense everything is political that  qualifying for the World Cup does create  a sort of more aggressive geopolitical  outlook but I think that this is not a  high priority and there are much more  concerning types of nationalism than  merely saying hey my family's from  Argentina by the way the US didn't even  make it so I didn't even have a choice  to make between the US and Argentina I'm  gonna root for Argentina I think it's  hot it's effectively harmless and if  somebody disagrees I want to hear from  you
 

